    "title": "Deadline Approaches To Buy Tickets For Chamber Leadership Banquet - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago This Friday is the last day that you can buy tickets to attend the Chamber Of Commerce Annual Community Leadership Awards Banquet, which will be held February 20th at The Ark Community and Sports Center in West Waynesville. Tickets are required to attend this event. No tickets will be available at the door. Tickets are now available at the chamber office at 25 dollars per person. For more information, contact the chamber office at 573-336-5121, or e-mail [email protected]. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
